        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c39" value="① Route A: read the dependency graph and Dependabot alerts through the API (the alert advisories come from the GitHub Advisory Database)&lt;br&gt;② Route B: the 2 pilots call sbom-generate, which hands the SBOM to the aggregation job&lt;br&gt;③ Read the external feeds (KEV, EPSS, OSV)&lt;br&gt;④ Open an Issue for each finding that meets the condition&lt;br&gt;⑤ Append the run record to supply-chain-runs (it carries the previous record's hash)&lt;br&gt;⑥ The watchdog checks the freshness and the chain of the records&lt;br&gt;⑦ The maintainer's machine checks the Hub workflow list and the records (it also catches the watchdog stopping)&lt;br&gt;⑧ The aggregation job reads the approved VEX decisions&lt;br&gt;⑨ Renovate opens update PRs&lt;br&gt;⑩ A person matches the component register against the advisories (dashed)&lt;br&gt;Solid arrow: automatic flow. Dashed arrow or frame: a person's step, or optional and not enabled." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=16;fontColor=#E6EDF3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1287" width="880" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c40" value="&lt;b&gt;*1 The numbers are configured values&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;12, 6 hours, 8 hours, 3 and 7 days, 24 hours, 180 days and 10 per run are policy settings (as of 2026-11-17), not measurements." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=16;fontColor=#E6EDF3;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
